 Copyright (C) 2016-2021 Hiroshima University

 MODEL NAME : HiSIM_SOI
 ( VERSION : 1  SUBVERSION : 5  REVISION : 0 )
 Model Parameter 'VERSION' : 1.50
 FILE : HSMSOI_FB_module.inc

 Date : 2021.10.08

 released by Hiroshima University

***********************************************************************/
